The MIT licence below covers the source code in this repository: the Nuxt
application, the career derivations, the work graph's geometry, the design
tokens and the build configuration. Take any of it.

It does not cover the personal content the site exists to present, which
remains copyright (c) 2026 Semir Mahovkic, all rights reserved:

  - server/data/career.json — the career record itself
  - the page copy in app/pages/ and app/components/portfolio/
  - public/favicon.ico, public/favicon.svg, public/apple-touch-icon.png —
    the wordmark and branding

The distinction is the obvious one: the machinery is reusable, the CV is not.
Fork the code and write your own history into it.

